{"ticker":"MET","updated":"2026-10-23T23:17:28Z","profile":{"longName":"MetLife, Inc.","shortName":"MetLife, Inc.","sector":"Financial Services","industry":"Insurance - Life","country":"United States","website":"https://www.metlife.com","fullTimeEmployees":46000,"marketCap":62797828096,"trailingPE":18.931036,"forwardPE":8.852015,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":0.79092455,"pegRatio":0.55,"targetMeanPrice":107.625,"targetHighPrice":119.0,"targetLowPrice":84.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":16,"recommendationKey":"buy","revenueGrowth":0.105,"earningsGrowth":0.058,"grossMargins":0.23951,"operatingMargins":0.055180002,"profitMargins":0.04567,"totalRevenue":79398002688,"beta":0.775,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":103.65,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":67.33,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NYQ","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":2.29},"summary":"MetLife, Inc., a financial services company, provides insurance, annuities, employee benefits, and asset management services worldwide. It operates in six segments: Group Benefits; Retirement and Income Solutions; Asia; Latin America; Europe, the Middle East and Africa; and MetLife Holdings. The company offers life, dental, group short-and long-term disability, paid family and medical leave, individual disability, accidental death and dismemberment, accident and health, vision, and pet insurance, as well as prepaid legal plans; administrative services-only arrangements to employers; and general and separate account, and synthetic guaranteed interest contracts, as well as private floating rate funding agreements. It also provides pension risk transfers, institutional income annuities, structured settlements, and capital markets investment products; and other products and services, such as life insurance products and funding agreements for funding postretirement benefits, as well as company, bank, or trust-owned life insurance used to finance nonqualified benefit programs for executives. In addition, it offers fixed, indexed-linked, and variable annuities; pension products; regular savings products; whole and term life, endowments, universal and variable life, and group life products; longevity and funded reinsurance solutions; credit insurance products; accident & health product","summary_zh":"MetLife, Inc. 是一家金融服務公司，在全球範圍內提供保險、年金、員工福利和資產管理服務。它分為六個部門：集團福利；退休和收入解決方案；亞洲;拉美;歐洲、中東和非洲；和大都會人壽控股。該公司提供人壽、牙科、團體短期和長期殘疾、帶薪家庭和病假、個人殘疾、意外死亡和肢解、事故和健康、視力和寵物保險，以及預付費法律計劃；僅向雇主提供行政服務的安排；普通帳戶和獨立帳戶、綜合擔保利息合約以及私人浮動利率融資協議。它還提供退休金風險轉移、機構收入年金、結構性結算和資本市場投資產品；以及其他產品和服務，例如人壽保險產品和為退休後福利提供資金的融資協議，以及用於為高管的不合格福利計劃提供資金的公司、銀行或信託擁有的人壽保險。此外，它還提供固定年金、指數掛鉤年金和可變年金；退休金產品；定期儲蓄產品；終身壽險和定期壽險、儲蓄壽險、萬能壽險和可變壽險以及團體壽險產品；長壽和資助再保險解決方案；信用保險產品；意外與健康產品","sector_zh":"金融服務","industry_zh":"保險 - 壽險","candles":[{"t":"2025-08-25","o":81.29,"h":81.68,"l":80.65,"c":80.83,"v":2585300},{"t":"2025-08-26","o":80.53,"h":81.11,"l":80.32,"c":81.01,"v":2905900},{"t":"2025-08-27","o":80.65,"h":81.58,"l":80.63,"c":81.11,"v":2556700},{"t":"2025-08-28","o":81.28,"h":81.28,"l":80.52,"c":80.8,"v":2225100},{"t":"2025-08-29","o":81.07,"h":81.68,"l":80.8,"c":81.36,"v":2759900},{"t":"2025-09-02","o":80.68,"h":80.96,"l":79.37,"c":80.56,"v":3836400},{"t":"2025-09-03","o":80.31,"h":80.94,"l":79.91,"c":80.57,"v":2364000},{"t":"2025-09-04","o":80.98,"h":81.86,"l":80.62,"c":81.75,"v":2434500},{"t":"2025-09-05","o":81.62,"h":82.31,"l":78.29,"c":79.51,"v":4830100},{"t":"2025-09-08","o":79.21,"h":79.7,"l":77.86,"c":79.6,"v":3048300},{"t":"2025-09-09","o":79.88,"h":80.33,"l":79.27,"c":79.29,"v":2536400},{"t":"2025-09-10","o":79.12,"h":79.95,"l":78.96,"c":79.23,"v":2113500},{"t":"2025-09-11","o":79.42,"h":80.5,"l":79.23,"c":80.34,"v":2632900},{"t":"2025-09-12","o":80.26,"h":81.11,"l":80.17,"c":80.82,"v":2314200},{"t":"2025-09-15","o":80.9,"h":81.3,"l":80.2,"c":80.46,"v":3083800},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":80.99,"h":80.99,"l":78.58,"c":78.73,"v":5022700},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":78.87,"h":79.71,"l":78.31,"c":78.68,"v":5561500},{"t":"2025-09-18","o":78.72,"h":79.74,"l":78.61,"c":79.07,"v":4484200},{"t":"2025-09-19","o":78.92,"h"